&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Apify's pricing page also shows a -10% annual toggle ($17, $179, $899), which was not rendered in static HTML during our check; all calculations below use verified monthly rates. Dataset/KV/queue storage, external data transfer, Google SERP proxies, Unblocker, and pay-per-event Actor fees are excluded.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

