&lt;strong&gt;Simple HTML (datacenter proxies):&lt;/strong&gt; Lightweight HTTP scraper on Apify using &lt;strong&gt;0.05 CU per 1,000 pages&lt;/strong&gt; (5 CUs total) vs. &lt;strong&gt;100,000 API credits&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;JS + Residential Proxies:&lt;/strong&gt; Headless browser on Apify using &lt;strong&gt;2.0 CUs per 1,000 pages&lt;/strong&gt; (200 CUs total) and &lt;strong&gt;1.5 MB per page&lt;/strong&gt; (150 GB residential traffic) vs. &lt;strong&gt;2,500,000 API credits&lt;/strong&gt; (100k × 25 credits).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

